# runtime/crewai@1.0.0 (#1090, #1083 F6). The versions F0 probed (multi-framework spec §6.1,
# §8.5), plus the kit's own packages (h11 for the model proxy's listener, httpx for its upstream
# calls, psycopg for memory and knowledge, OpenTelemetry for traces). No crewai-tools. crewai
# pulls chromadb, lancedb and onnxruntime, which only its memory and RAG storage import; both
# are off, and the packages stay in the lock so pip-audit covers them (§13.5).
